OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,6,FThursday and Friday will be chilly and
OL,7,Fmostly dry with bright spells, just a
OL,8,Ffew showers in the east. Dry but
OL,9,Fchilly Saturday with bright or sunny
OL,10,Fspells. Overnight frosts.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
